{"page":481,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"토콜과 달리 IP는 최선형(best-effort) 데이터그램 서비스를 제공하므로 어떤 랑그 계층 네트워","words":[{"text":"토콜과","x":137,"y":290,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"달리","x":245,"y":290,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"IP는","x":322,"y":291,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"최선형(best-effort)","x":399,"y":290,"width":255,"height":35},{"text":"데이터그램","x":671,"y":290,"width":146,"height":36},{"text":"서비스를","x":835,"y":293,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"제공하므로","x":968,"y":294,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":1134,"y":293,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"랑그","x":1212,"y":292,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"계층","x":1287,"y":292,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"네트워","x":1365,"y":291,"width":92,"height":35}]},{"text":"7이 기술에서도 동작한다. 따라서 어떠한 패것 네트워크도 인터넷에 집속할 수 있게 되었다.","words":[{"text":"7이","x":140,"y":346,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"기술에서도","x":181,"y":346,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"동작한다.","x":348,"y":346,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"따라서","x":490,"y":345,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"어떠한","x":592,"y":345,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"패것","x":695,"y":347,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크도","x":767,"y":348,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷에","x":927,"y":349,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"집속할","x":1061,"y":348,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1160,"y":349,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"있게","x":1204,"y":347,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"되었다.","x":1278,"y":346,"width":100,"height":34}]},{"text":"불행하게도 IP의 큰 강점은 이제 결점이 되었다. IP는 인터넷의 발전을 특성 방향으로 제한","words":[{"text":"불행하게도","x":204,"y":402,"width":158,"height":35},{"text":"IP의","x":374,"y":403,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"큰","x":447,"y":404,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"강점은","x":489,"y":401,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"이제","x":590,"y":401,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"결점이","x":664,"y":402,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"되었다.","x":765,"y":403,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"IP는","x":874,"y":405,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"인터넷의","x":947,"y":403,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"발전을","x":1079,"y":403,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"특성","x":1182,"y":402,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"방향으로","x":1257,"y":401,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"제한","x":1397,"y":402,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"한다. 최근에 많은 연구자들이 에플리게이션 계층에만 관심을 갖고 있다. 무신 에드 혹 네트위그","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":137,"y":456,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"최근에","x":221,"y":458,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":327,"y":458,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"연구자들이","x":401,"y":456,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"에플리게이션","x":562,"y":456,"width":180,"height":36},{"text":"계층에만","x":757,"y":458,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"관심을","x":886,"y":458,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"갖고","x":989,"y":458,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1061,"y":458,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"무신","x":1140,"y":458,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"에드","x":1214,"y":457,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"혹","x":1287,"y":457,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"네트위그","x":1333,"y":457,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"나 센서 네트워크, 위성 네트워크에 대한 연구도 많이 진행되고 있다. 이러한 네트위그들은 독립","words":[{"text":"나","x":138,"y":512,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"센서","x":181,"y":513,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크,","x":256,"y":513,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"위성","x":400,"y":513,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크에","x":472,"y":512,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":635,"y":512,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"연구도","x":707,"y":513,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"많이","x":807,"y":513,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"진행되고","x":879,"y":513,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1010,"y":513,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"이러한","x":1090,"y":512,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"네트위그들은","x":1194,"y":512,"width":188,"height":33},{"text":"독립","x":1395,"y":513,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"시스템 또는 링크 계층 시스템으로 볼 수 있으며, 따라서 IP의 구속을 받지 않기 때문에 성상 가","words":[{"text":"시스템","x":139,"y":568,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"또는","x":243,"y":571,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"링크","x":320,"y":569,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"계층","x":393,"y":569,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"시스템으로","x":465,"y":568,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"볼","x":626,"y":568,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":667,"y":568,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있으며,","x":712,"y":568,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"따라서","x":820,"y":568,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"IP의","x":922,"y":567,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"구속을","x":993,"y":567,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"받지","x":1096,"y":567,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"않기","x":1169,"y":567,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"때문에","x":1245,"y":567,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"성상","x":1351,"y":567,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"가","x":1428,"y":568,"width":32,"height":34}]},{"text":"능성이 있다.","words":[{"text":"능성이","x":138,"y":624,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":244,"y":625,"width":68,"height":34}]},{"text":"많은 사람들이 새로운 인터넷 에플리게이션의 플랫폼으로서 P2P 시스템의 가능성에 대해","words":[{"text":"많은","x":205,"y":681,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"사람들이","x":282,"y":679,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"새로운","x":420,"y":680,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷","x":525,"y":679,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"에플리게이션의","x":628,"y":679,"width":207,"height":35},{"text":"플랫폼으로서","x":852,"y":679,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"P2P","x":1046,"y":682,"width":55,"height":27},{"text":"시스템의","x":1116,"y":678,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"가능성에","x":1254,"y":678,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":1398,"y":679,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"관심을 갖고 있다. 그러나 P2P 시스템은 인터넷 자원을 비효율적으로 사용한다. 인터넷이 모든","words":[{"text":"관심을","x":137,"y":735,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"갖고","x":244,"y":736,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":322,"y":735,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"그러나","x":403,"y":736,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"P2P","x":507,"y":739,"width":55,"height":27},{"text":"시스템은","x":576,"y":734,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"인터넷","x":711,"y":735,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"자원을","x":812,"y":735,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"비효율적으로","x":916,"y":733,"width":179,"height":35},{"text":"사용한다.","x":1109,"y":734,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷이","x":1256,"y":734,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"모든","x":1396,"y":735,"width":65,"height":33}]},{"text":"종류의 장치를 상호연결하고 미래의 P2P 가능한 애플리게이션을 지원할 수 있도록 성장하기 때","words":[{"text":"종류의","x":137,"y":791,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"장치를","x":243,"y":792,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"상호연결하고","x":348,"y":791,"width":183,"height":34},{"text":"미래의","x":545,"y":790,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"P2P","x":645,"y":794,"width":56,"height":27},{"text":"가능한","x":713,"y":791,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"애플리게이션을","x":815,"y":789,"width":211,"height":36},{"text":"지원할","x":1039,"y":789,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1140,"y":790,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있도록","x":1184,"y":790,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"성장하기","x":1289,"y":790,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"때","x":1430,"y":790,"width":27,"height":34}]},{"text":"문에 인터넷 코어의 전송 능력 및 스위칭 능력이 인터넷에 가해지는 트래픽 요구보다 더 빨리","words":[{"text":"문에","x":137,"y":845,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷","x":215,"y":846,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"코어의","x":323,"y":847,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"전송","x":431,"y":847,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"능력","x":503,"y":846,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"및","x":580,"y":846,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"스위칭","x":622,"y":846,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"능력이","x":727,"y":847,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷에","x":833,"y":845,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"가해지는","x":967,"y":845,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"트래픽","x":1102,"y":846,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"요구보다","x":1209,"y":846,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"더","x":1352,"y":846,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"빨리","x":1398,"y":846,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"계속 중가할 수 있을지 의문이다. 용량을 과배il(overprovisioning)하지 않고 악성 공격이나 혼","words":[{"text":"계속","x":139,"y":900,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"중가할","x":211,"y":901,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":318,"y":902,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있을지","x":365,"y":902,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"의문이다.","x":469,"y":901,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"용량을","x":609,"y":901,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"과배il(overprovisioning)하지","x":713,"y":900,"width":408,"height":39},{"text":"않고","x":1138,"y":900,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"악성","x":1213,"y":901,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"공격이나","x":1288,"y":902,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"혼","x":1429,"y":902,"width":32,"height":33}]},{"text":"잡이 있는 상황에서 네트워크의 안정성을 보장하는 것이 주요한 일이 될 것이다.","words":[{"text":"잡이","x":138,"y":955,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":212,"y":956,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"상황에서","x":283,"y":957,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크의","x":421,"y":957,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"안정성을","x":583,"y":957,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"보장하는","x":715,"y":957,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":849,"y":957,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"주요한","x":918,"y":957,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"일이","x":1023,"y":956,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"될","x":1093,"y":956,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":1137,"y":956,"width":96,"height":35}]},{"text":"인터넷의 괄목할 만한 성장은 네트워크 운영자와 기업 측면에서 상당히 빠른 속도로 새로","words":[{"text":"인터넷의","x":206,"y":1011,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"괄목할","x":342,"y":1012,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"만한","x":450,"y":1012,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"성장은","x":525,"y":1012,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":629,"y":1012,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"운영자와","x":761,"y":1013,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"기업","x":899,"y":1012,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"측면에서","x":971,"y":1012,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"상당히","x":1105,"y":1012,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"빠른","x":1213,"y":1013,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"속도로","x":1287,"y":1013,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"새로","x":1397,"y":1013,"width":62,"height":33}]},{"text":"운 IP 주소의 할당을 요구하고 있다. 현재 속도라면 할당되지 않은 1Pv4 주소가 수년 이내로 고","words":[{"text":"운","x":139,"y":1067,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"IP","x":181,"y":1070,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"주소의","x":223,"y":1067,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"할당을","x":329,"y":1067,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"요구하고","x":435,"y":1067,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":571,"y":1067,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"현재","x":651,"y":1067,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"속도라면","x":723,"y":1068,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"할당되지","x":856,"y":1068,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"않은","x":990,"y":1068,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"1Pv4","x":1063,"y":1072,"width":65,"height":26},{"text":"주소가","x":1141,"y":1068,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"수년","x":1245,"y":1068,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"이내로","x":1322,"y":1068,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"고","x":1428,"y":1072,"width":32,"height":25}]},{"text":"갈될 것이다. 그렇게 되면 1Pv6 주소 공간에서만 여러 개의 연속된 블록으로 주소를 할당받을","words":[{"text":"갈될","x":140,"y":1122,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":215,"y":1122,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"그렇게","x":330,"y":1122,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"되면","x":438,"y":1123,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"1Pv6","x":512,"y":1127,"width":65,"height":26},{"text":"주소","x":592,"y":1124,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"공간에서만","x":667,"y":1122,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":834,"y":1123,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":908,"y":1124,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"연속된","x":984,"y":1123,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"블록으로","x":1087,"y":1123,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"주소를","x":1224,"y":1124,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"할당받을","x":1333,"y":1124,"width":127,"height":34}]},{"text":"수 있다. 초기에 1Pv6를 사용하는 것이 이득이 별로 없어서 1Pv6 새우이 더디어져 1Pv4와 1Pv6","words":[{"text":"수","x":139,"y":1178,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":183,"y":1178,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"초기에","x":263,"y":1178,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"1Pv6를","x":368,"y":1180,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"사용하는","x":479,"y":1178,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":615,"y":1178,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"이득이","x":686,"y":1178,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"별로","x":790,"y":1179,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"없어서","x":862,"y":1179,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"1Pv6","x":963,"y":1183,"width":65,"height":27},{"text":"새우이","x":1041,"y":1179,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"더디어져","x":1146,"y":1179,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"1Pv4와","x":1280,"y":1179,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"1Pv6","x":1392,"y":1183,"width":68,"height":26}]},{"text":"가 향후 오랫동안 인터넷에 공존할 것으로 예상된다. 1Pv4가 우세한 인터넷을 1Pv6가 우세한 인","words":[{"text":"가","x":141,"y":1234,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"향후","x":180,"y":1233,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"오랫동안","x":253,"y":1233,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"인터넷에","x":391,"y":1234,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"공존할","x":523,"y":1233,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"것으로","x":628,"y":1233,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"예상된다.","x":729,"y":1234,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"1Pv4가","x":867,"y":1234,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"우세한","x":975,"y":1234,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"인터넷을","x":1079,"y":1234,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"1Pv6가","x":1211,"y":1234,"width":100,"height":33},{"text":"우세한","x":1321,"y":1234,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"인","x":1429,"y":1235,"width":29,"height":33}]},{"text":"터넷으로 성공적으로 변화시기려면 전 세계적으로 상당한 노력을 기울여야 할 것으로 생각된다.","words":[{"text":"터넷으로","x":141,"y":1289,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"성공적으로","x":273,"y":1289,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"변화시기려면","x":441,"y":1289,"width":182,"height":35},{"text":"전","x":637,"y":1289,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"세계적으로","x":676,"y":1289,"width":150,"height":34},{"text":"상당한","x":837,"y":1289,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"노력을","x":939,"y":1290,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"기울여야","x":1043,"y":1289,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1175,"y":1289,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"것으로","x":1219,"y":1289,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"생각된다.","x":1322,"y":1289,"width":133,"height":